{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "95305110d209520cc24ac11d79529199da5b0a79fdf9a70d7dbb5fd7349ecf92",
  "bundle_request_count": 17,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:27788fba6a19344023fdf4ab567bd03f684b7e091a89788436ff9635f20c4df7",
      "request_id": "27788fba6a19344023fdf4ab567bd03f684b7e091a89788436ff9635f20c4df7",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a9e6cc0506e49611ff1fda803c693873",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "昨天广州，一场球没打，有人直接进了八强。西尼亚科娃右肩受伤，赛前退赛。就在前一天，她刚打完一场三盘鏖战。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d114da4e3c4de02587636780bd7fba6c2bfeab7fce63e7517d2bfb02517aab35",
      "words_sha256": "d03acd5f9593ab8928887335b10756ae2d15aa1b31603defbb69bab5f699e263"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:353b5bea16776946fa712ec735ff3424b215c02e173156c5f89e327a7ec11672",
      "request_id": "353b5bea16776946fa712ec735ff3424b215c02e173156c5f89e327a7ec11672",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f7ee7b4ac0e635bc0c6447539596554d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这种事，在最大的舞台上也发生过。2022 年温网，纳达尔腹肌撕裂，半决赛前开发布会退赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "95ef5137b09927e1d5738cff152e270ace8c9813456d748e7b092ed075d7cc13",
      "words_sha256": "b230a38e9a3b5274a50b08a8dcb2558615d74b88bd27847f3b3618fdebea0785"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:45955a601f9922643fb10c0201ada6784b07224ac4ae174791564e848f2643f9",
      "request_id": "45955a601f9922643fb10c0201ada6784b07224ac4ae174791564e848f2643f9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6e45a48b88551b3f8fd75c9074f42bef",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "但 walkover 有一条硬线：必须是开打之前。只要打了哪怕一分再退，那叫退赛，要记比分、算胜负。刘婧文这一场，一分没打。不算一场胜利，不进胜负记录，也不进两个人的交手记录。连胜纪录还会在这里断片：你正处在 19 连胜，中间收到一个 walkover，再赢一场，官方连胜是 20，不是 21——因为中间那一场，根本不存在。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "20aadeb3dffbfb3179219b41aa81cccbeb49896085e312af50fb8391c1899bd1",
      "words_sha256": "93af3a26af5e4b3e8434a8f4c3eeb55dfca8eafdd3317593537c4d81c4e7d532"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4c702edd09be19bd1d9e4b8d3c889f4af02330bdae36f93a2b01683074154a30",
      "request_id": "4c702edd09be19bd1d9e4b8d3c889f4af02330bdae36f93a2b01683074154a30",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fff67c6b39fe8a687c4d41df5cb3269b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "大阪夺冠后的连胜已经来到第六场；第二天，她的名字从签表上消失了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b458b1e4b91382089fa1b99e30e19a31a74fdce3bdf5251cafa6ad450321c490",
      "words_sha256": "879e8466e38343fab2827c7886b3a3b407b1a75b723661d8319ee8e20ca24728"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5048daca2db4b4b0e284230655fef179a075f989f0132a7b9fb032de865c605a",
      "request_id": "5048daca2db4b4b0e284230655fef179a075f989f0132a7b9fb032de865c605a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e860ba2b50de74ef4264a87c1c421ffe",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "好玩的在后面：收到 walkover 的人，下一场到底占没占到便宜？先看一对同站对照。2012 年迈阿密，穆雷一站收到两次 walkover 进决赛，还是输了，他赛后自己说，接发不在状态，开场需要几局找节奏——决赛第一盘他 1 比 6 就交了学费。两年后同一站，德约也收到两次 walkover，决赛 6 比 3、6 比 3 横扫纳达尔夺冠。有意思的是，纳达尔那届半决赛也收到一个 walkover，两个受益者在决赛对撞，一个捧杯，一个亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "10e87fdb22be9f965d944c8a303211e0728d44aa1ad522b87e0ce9f6074a62c0",
      "words_sha256": "75d08e58b83bb0d759e676687075dd00e3efa3a95d1ecfbccbb5471e7e6cff32"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5dafe1d0723f3d517b7e1ea22c5c056ce1fa22d1fa5e78068c303e04cbfbc4b3",
      "request_id": "5dafe1d0723f3d517b7e1ea22c5c056ce1fa22d1fa5e78068c303e04cbfbc4b3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c5e6946e76eb8fad9b06e8beb4b9bea4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "克耶高斯直接走进了决赛——他职业生涯唯一一个大满贯决赛，是走进去的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d9b485b618b2f49a01cdb9db3d3ce1373d12c9ec6bbc9e3abe369824353e2c62",
      "words_sha256": "4159f3694e7f2a03ed4a1060da2eb8aa4b786352a300129b5b409132f4045917"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6c63db4ce5c9bcac160d22f6a419246f51bd8a2300c5e79269ba645bfe3ba4e6",
      "request_id": "6c63db4ce5c9bcac160d22f6a419246f51bd8a2300c5e79269ba645bfe3ba4e6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "74b83a89203a53ff97c0f835e548b61f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "赢球为什么靠走？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "831be50099b2359d63776b9ce2c8b82502f2af4a3ba5e389f038189bfd36740e",
      "words_sha256": "b507204086022e0c00014b14f23c08cc1c063f425f00fc69ed4c8041c1a667ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8ef5554c313e9ae4ee850e422d1d44c39b92f9a9af8fbceae1c3395d50cfd29a",
      "request_id": "8ef5554c313e9ae4ee850e422d1d44c39b92f9a9af8fbceae1c3395d50cfd29a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "672ec96ad096d12c126870b6b4712230",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "再看德约自己。2024 年温网，四分之一决赛德米纳尔退赛，他省力进四强，半决赛直落三盘赢了；可决赛呢？2 比 6、2 比 6、6 比 7，被阿尔卡拉斯打得没有还手之力。多休的那一天，没换来冠军。克耶高斯走进决赛那次，6 比 4 先拿一盘，最后连丢三盘。格拉诺列斯 2016 年在法网躲开了纳达尔，下一轮就被蒂姆送走，只多留了一轮。佩内塔 2013 年温网收到阿扎伦卡的退赛礼，下一场先吞一个 0 比 6，再逆转，打出了自己五年来在温网的最好成绩——白捡的便宜，她兑现得最实在。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6cd98050ed67f107752c44e90029356a38ae802ba1647334f05f0cb4bc2583ef",
      "words_sha256": "e7ca0e90605ce0009fc800d7647a2ab9843d9aec17b2f098ee6c83fac5a5efff"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:accac5308f0f5f9c1077e8969c1135c42d85e1a64ceaed7c56b27dd032d00af7",
      "request_id": "accac5308f0f5f9c1077e8969c1135c42d85e1a64ceaed7c56b27dd032d00af7",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "01558108ad53f3a281f727259aa9d757",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "隔壁场上，16 岁的孙心然这一场打了 2 小时 41 分钟。第二盘 4 比 5 落后，她叫了医疗暂停，缠好绷带；到了决胜盘，绷带拆了硬撑，2 比 5 落后、对方手握赛点——她一分一分往回爬，抢七 7 比 3 拿下。终场哨响，她哭了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "077af12dedb0870140b8054f8d033a2c0031de7d694cfe0a69918a056dcdeae8",
      "words_sha256": "602f17fec6a2f02b09c9059505c100a2f271bc2c69b7a6ba9c3806a0c5b826d8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "329863408d19b651ad207b3ddd15948600466c7c5dc7fe4084f1a469fd2be8ab",
      "words_sha256": "bb371455942874977b3cf9931ffff5c7dc8edb8ad37adc407760e65dfcb2a596"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:cf0b60040f72ebf38a89cde659ffac81791f8d537b61a9a7fa0f6e6068953a09",
      "request_id": "cf0b60040f72ebf38a89cde659ffac81791f8d537b61a9a7fa0f6e6068953a09",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0af20457a6d3fa49cf5ec33ffe5a0128",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她的对手刘婧文，一分没打，晋级。刘婧文自己的首轮也打了近三个小时，她多赚的，是整整一天休息。签表上，她的名字旁边记着一个记号：walkover。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "4461578a53dc43e2966910039330c9689b49c805420cff43359b92dd35167c43",
      "words_sha256": "8c0ad75e88e2f10d92263c1e7af3b5dc585644ba33a172a62622bb1279d6c0da"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d593676ebf39813132c950f6a600f569c9892f1593286ee102784c058d3e6b60",
      "request_id": "d593676ebf39813132c950f6a600f569c9892f1593286ee102784c058d3e6b60",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "184a6a94332af13c255109be58329654",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "而退赛的人呢？费德勒 2014 年退掉总决赛决赛，整整一周后，戴维斯杯决赛：周五他带伤输了单打，周六双打赢了，周日直落三盘锁定胜局，帮瑞士拿到队史第一座戴维斯杯。当时被骂「留力」的一次退赛，七天后，成了布局。把这些样本摆在一起，收到 walkover 的人下一场是 3 胜 3 负。也有统计研究专门算过：walkover 对下一场，测不出任何正向或负向的影响。所以结论可能有点反直觉：省力不等于躺赢，没打比赛也不等于没状态。walkover 送走的，从来不是胜负，是确定性。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "52c7a28430ba78cb89b4cd980175acbdce8c33cade8532edc28b52e272d428d8",
      "words_sha256": "7f12466ab137b4c89ccbd1c3d9fb2764861cc516721c1ccc4aaef54103e3e180"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e030f8e033a6821dc2bd02a822cca3c45f84d451fe65caea15e3e42ba8399066",
      "request_id": "e030f8e033a6821dc2bd02a822cca3c45f84d451fe65caea15e3e42ba8399066",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "13768ad83dc634ef3cbcb01681f6029c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那积分和奖金呢？这笔账分三层。WTA 规则书里写得明明白白：首轮白捡的，只按上一轮给分；打过、赢过之后再收到的，按所达轮次给分。刘婧文首轮赢了球，所以她四分之一决赛的积分，照拿。她真正多赚的不是积分，是那一整天的休息，和对手身上那 2 小时 41 分钟的消耗。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8dc918cbdded8f1903fb122e30b56e4d3e4d833661bc27df58bf8a94755f4db9",
      "words_sha256": "cd0562730ab554292eb8dc63f1d76a4515f00adf0b9b0f5cb39d163964bc7eb0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e10b97333fd122ab5e32e229f9dd00b180d588298efc899f71aac895e703d7a5",
      "request_id": "e10b97333fd122ab5e32e229f9dd00b180d588298efc899f71aac895e703d7a5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6002fb1dc5309940750182931da9df21",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "不战而胜，英文就是 walk over——走着赢。可一场没开打的比赛，为什么偏偏要用一个「走」字？因为它根本不是网球发明的，是从赛马借来的。两百年前的英国赛马，对手如果全部退赛，只剩一匹马，按规矩它也不能直接领奖，必须自己慢慢走完整个赛道，才算赢。18 世纪那匹传奇赛马 Eclipse 强到没人敢跟它跑，18 场胜利里差不多一半，是这么「走」出来的。后来这个词进了网球：对手来不了，你就等于独自走完了这场比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "01bc6d87c4d30b089f1a817ab4175ba2ffbb9a41a6df0568c21ed5e72bc58997",
      "words_sha256": "a70bf50a4f1ae7c0f7badbabefd68c6cadaac8ff1925237c2627470ef6c00d0a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ecdb8eb8e696339bc4e5018e6f6706d45dfee1a30cb2fbf35b7eb67f7d8ca41d",
      "request_id": "ecdb8eb8e696339bc4e5018e6f6706d45dfee1a30cb2fbf35b7eb67f7d8ca41d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0ab8a18446fbbe7fdfc4e4153af7706c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "德约科维奇不战而冠，那是这项赛事四十五年历史上，决赛第一次没打成。组委会临时拉来穆雷，陪德约打了一场表演赛，给买了票的观众一个交代。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f60fc9f31f3133ac9df89af64e571b3476af9d4411b014cd9a767c1b18e4ea43",
      "words_sha256": "042b6232fb9ce1440fa182f5c78fb931536794f269b7a2a8af4cc656907e6cf8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ee7d3e989f4ed3bded04bbffd24f9cdceba266e557af01142e024637ce091728",
      "request_id": "ee7d3e989f4ed3bded04bbffd24f9cdceba266e557af01142e024637ce091728",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a2dd54eb37464316d726e814541600b8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "下一轮，休息了一整天的刘婧文，对上刚从悬崖边爬回来的孙心然。这一场，就是这条规矩最新的一次现场考试。要是由你来定规矩：一分没打就晋级，积分照拿，还白赚一天休息——这条规矩，该留吗？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "fa0a702e9db728078efe6bc82278bc44ecb66bc6d3f9935e59b8b22092d580c2",
      "words_sha256": "387a67d5d6f28e893ff218530733dc5d7231773720fc65f94a5b1b1ba0d38499"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f4ed01eead122b94aed9e8e99a9ca6e8dfcd6ad367b9d11f3ef5e497624a6fac",
      "request_id": "f4ed01eead122b94aed9e8e99a9ca6e8dfcd6ad367b9d11f3ef5e497624a6fac",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8483854b3455274f2c7610a15a1b41ff",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2014 年年终总决赛更夸张。费德勒在决赛开打前约一小时宣布背伤退赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b5ae496eecd1828a941b80eaf91b4cf0bae391796221dfd17587b33d0608d132",
      "words_sha256": "8a1013a4754217632648d933de63ca7d484dd1d3b8df9542f4ed1d84b43751e1"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_00.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d114da4e3c4de02587636780bd7fba6c2bfeab7fce63e7517d2bfb02517aab35",
      "words_sha256": "d03acd5f9593ab8928887335b10756ae2d15aa1b31603defbb69bab5f699e263",
      "words_path": "voice_00.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a9e6cc0506e49611ff1fda803c693873",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "昨天广州，一场球没打，有人直接进了八强。西尼亚科娃右肩受伤，赛前退赛。就在前一天，她刚打完一场三盘鏖战。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b458b1e4b91382089fa1b99e30e19a31a74fdce3bdf5251cafa6ad450321c490",
      "words_sha256": "879e8466e38343fab2827c7886b3a3b407b1a75b723661d8319ee8e20ca24728",
      "words_path": "voice_01.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fff67c6b39fe8a687c4d41df5cb3269b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "大阪夺冠后的连胜已经来到第六场；第二天，她的名字从签表上消失了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "4461578a53dc43e2966910039330c9689b49c805420cff43359b92dd35167c43",
      "words_sha256": "8c0ad75e88e2f10d92263c1e7af3b5dc585644ba33a172a62622bb1279d6c0da",
      "words_path": "voice_02.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0af20457a6d3fa49cf5ec33ffe5a0128",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她的对手刘婧文，一分没打，晋级。刘婧文自己的首轮也打了近三个小时，她多赚的，是整整一天休息。签表上，她的名字旁边记着一个记号：walkover。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "077af12dedb0870140b8054f8d033a2c0031de7d694cfe0a69918a056dcdeae8",
      "words_sha256": "602f17fec6a2f02b09c9059505c100a2f271bc2c69b7a6ba9c3806a0c5b826d8",
      "words_path": "voice_03.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "01558108ad53f3a281f727259aa9d757",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "隔壁场上，16 岁的孙心然这一场打了 2 小时 41 分钟。第二盘 4 比 5 落后，她叫了医疗暂停，缠好绷带；到了决胜盘，绷带拆了硬撑，2 比 5 落后、对方手握赛点——她一分一分往回爬，抢七 7 比 3 拿下。终场哨响，她哭了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "01bc6d87c4d30b089f1a817ab4175ba2ffbb9a41a6df0568c21ed5e72bc58997",
      "words_sha256": "a70bf50a4f1ae7c0f7badbabefd68c6cadaac8ff1925237c2627470ef6c00d0a",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6002fb1dc5309940750182931da9df21",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "不战而胜，英文就是 walk over——走着赢。可一场没开打的比赛，为什么偏偏要用一个「走」字？因为它根本不是网球发明的，是从赛马借来的。两百年前的英国赛马，对手如果全部退赛，只剩一匹马，按规矩它也不能直接领奖，必须自己慢慢走完整个赛道，才算赢。18 世纪那匹传奇赛马 Eclipse 强到没人敢跟它跑，18 场胜利里差不多一半，是这么「走」出来的。后来这个词进了网球：对手来不了，你就等于独自走完了这场比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "20aadeb3dffbfb3179219b41aa81cccbeb49896085e312af50fb8391c1899bd1",
      "words_sha256": "93af3a26af5e4b3e8434a8f4c3eeb55dfca8eafdd3317593537c4d81c4e7d532",
      "words_path": "voice_05.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6e45a48b88551b3f8fd75c9074f42bef",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "但 walkover 有一条硬线：必须是开打之前。只要打了哪怕一分再退，那叫退赛，要记比分、算胜负。刘婧文这一场，一分没打。不算一场胜利，不进胜负记录，也不进两个人的交手记录。连胜纪录还会在这里断片：你正处在 19 连胜，中间收到一个 walkover，再赢一场，官方连胜是 20，不是 21——因为中间那一场，根本不存在。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8dc918cbdded8f1903fb122e30b56e4d3e4d833661bc27df58bf8a94755f4db9",
      "words_sha256": "cd0562730ab554292eb8dc63f1d76a4515f00adf0b9b0f5cb39d163964bc7eb0",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "13768ad83dc634ef3cbcb01681f6029c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那积分和奖金呢？这笔账分三层。WTA 规则书里写得明明白白：首轮白捡的，只按上一轮给分；打过、赢过之后再收到的，按所达轮次给分。刘婧文首轮赢了球，所以她四分之一决赛的积分，照拿。她真正多赚的不是积分，是那一整天的休息，和对手身上那 2 小时 41 分钟的消耗。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "95ef5137b09927e1d5738cff152e270ace8c9813456d748e7b092ed075d7cc13",
      "words_sha256": "b230a38e9a3b5274a50b08a8dcb2558615d74b88bd27847f3b3618fdebea0785",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f7ee7b4ac0e635bc0c6447539596554d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这种事，在最大的舞台上也发生过。2022 年温网，纳达尔腹肌撕裂，半决赛前开发布会退赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d9b485b618b2f49a01cdb9db3d3ce1373d12c9ec6bbc9e3abe369824353e2c62",
      "words_sha256": "4159f3694e7f2a03ed4a1060da2eb8aa4b786352a300129b5b409132f4045917",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c5e6946e76eb8fad9b06e8beb4b9bea4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "克耶高斯直接走进了决赛——他职业生涯唯一一个大满贯决赛，是走进去的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b5ae496eecd1828a941b80eaf91b4cf0bae391796221dfd17587b33d0608d132",
      "words_sha256": "8a1013a4754217632648d933de63ca7d484dd1d3b8df9542f4ed1d84b43751e1",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8483854b3455274f2c7610a15a1b41ff",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2014 年年终总决赛更夸张。费德勒在决赛开打前约一小时宣布背伤退赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f60fc9f31f3133ac9df89af64e571b3476af9d4411b014cd9a767c1b18e4ea43",
      "words_sha256": "042b6232fb9ce1440fa182f5c78fb931536794f269b7a2a8af4cc656907e6cf8",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0ab8a18446fbbe7fdfc4e4153af7706c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "德约科维奇不战而冠，那是这项赛事四十五年历史上，决赛第一次没打成。组委会临时拉来穆雷，陪德约打了一场表演赛，给买了票的观众一个交代。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "10e87fdb22be9f965d944c8a303211e0728d44aa1ad522b87e0ce9f6074a62c0",
      "words_sha256": "75d08e58b83bb0d759e676687075dd00e3efa3a95d1ecfbccbb5471e7e6cff32",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e860ba2b50de74ef4264a87c1c421ffe",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "好玩的在后面：收到 walkover 的人，下一场到底占没占到便宜？先看一对同站对照。2012 年迈阿密，穆雷一站收到两次 walkover 进决赛，还是输了，他赛后自己说，接发不在状态，开场需要几局找节奏——决赛第一盘他 1 比 6 就交了学费。两年后同一站，德约也收到两次 walkover，决赛 6 比 3、6 比 3 横扫纳达尔夺冠。有意思的是，纳达尔那届半决赛也收到一个 walkover，两个受益者在决赛对撞，一个捧杯，一个亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "6cd98050ed67f107752c44e90029356a38ae802ba1647334f05f0cb4bc2583ef",
      "words_sha256": "e7ca0e90605ce0009fc800d7647a2ab9843d9aec17b2f098ee6c83fac5a5efff",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "672ec96ad096d12c126870b6b4712230",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "再看德约自己。2024 年温网，四分之一决赛德米纳尔退赛，他省力进四强，半决赛直落三盘赢了；可决赛呢？2 比 6、2 比 6、6 比 7，被阿尔卡拉斯打得没有还手之力。多休的那一天，没换来冠军。克耶高斯走进决赛那次，6 比 4 先拿一盘，最后连丢三盘。格拉诺列斯 2016 年在法网躲开了纳达尔，下一轮就被蒂姆送走，只多留了一轮。佩内塔 2013 年温网收到阿扎伦卡的退赛礼，下一场先吞一个 0 比 6，再逆转，打出了自己五年来在温网的最好成绩——白捡的便宜，她兑现得最实在。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "52c7a28430ba78cb89b4cd980175acbdce8c33cade8532edc28b52e272d428d8",
      "words_sha256": "7f12466ab137b4c89ccbd1c3d9fb2764861cc516721c1ccc4aaef54103e3e180",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "184a6a94332af13c255109be58329654",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "而退赛的人呢？费德勒 2014 年退掉总决赛决赛，整整一周后，戴维斯杯决赛：周五他带伤输了单打，周六双打赢了，周日直落三盘锁定胜局，帮瑞士拿到队史第一座戴维斯杯。当时被骂「留力」的一次退赛，七天后，成了布局。把这些样本摆在一起，收到 walkover 的人下一场是 3 胜 3 负。也有统计研究专门算过：walkover 对下一场，测不出任何正向或负向的影响。所以结论可能有点反直觉：省力不等于躺赢，没打比赛也不等于没状态。walkover 送走的，从来不是胜负，是确定性。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "fa0a702e9db728078efe6bc82278bc44ecb66bc6d3f9935e59b8b22092d580c2",
      "words_sha256": "387a67d5d6f28e893ff218530733dc5d7231773720fc65f94a5b1b1ba0d38499",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a2dd54eb37464316d726e814541600b8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "下一轮，休息了一整天的刘婧文，对上刚从悬崖边爬回来的孙心然。这一场，就是这条规矩最新的一次现场考试。要是由你来定规矩：一分没打就晋级，积分照拿，还白赚一天休息——这条规矩，该留吗？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "831be50099b2359d63776b9ce2c8b82502f2af4a3ba5e389f038189bfd36740e",
      "words_sha256": "b507204086022e0c00014b14f23c08cc1c063f425f00fc69ed4c8041c1a667ff",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "74b83a89203a53ff97c0f835e548b61f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "赢球为什么靠走？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "329863408d19b651ad207b3ddd15948600466c7c5dc7fe4084f1a469fd2be8ab",
      "words_sha256": "bb371455942874977b3cf9931ffff5c7dc8edb8ad37adc407760e65dfcb2a596",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
